	(text "The FTDI chip outputs 3.3V logic, but with\nCMOS logic this is right at the limit of logic\nhigh on a 5V device (5V*0.7=3.5V). If the\ntemperature rises, the required transition\nlevel will increase and may fail in some situations."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 312.42 129.54 0)
